{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01TwmUQCD5v4x7JwHrUPHLHr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand this request:\n\n1. I'm in the SPIRAL system (autonomous agent loop)\n2. I need to implement story **US-265** from prd.json\n3. I should NOT pick a different story\n4. I need to read prd.json for full details and progress.txt for codebase context\n5. Then implement ONLY US-265\n\nLet me start by reading the context files:\n- prd.json to get the story details\n- progress.txt for codebase patterns\n- Then check the current state of the project\n\nThe system prompt tells me I should:\n1. Read story context (prd.json and progress.txt)\n2. Produce an implementation plan\n3. Execute the plan\n4. Run quality checks\n5. Update prd.json\n6. Document learnings\n7. Commit changes\n\nLet me start reading the files.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21655,"cache_read_input_tokens":30702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21655},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"80d00f4c-4638-42b3-9c87-be548860870f","uuid":"f3860a47-e906-4bc3-b841-215e31c646a6"}
